MEWATI TUNE PLAYER — MASTER FIX LIST (3 AI cross-verified, false positives hataye gaye)

═══════════════════════════
🔴 CRITICAL
═══════════════════════════

1. lib/app.dart (~113) + lib/core/widgets/debug_panel.dart (~20-21)
   DebugPanel release build mein bhi render hota hai (kDebugMode gate jaan-bujh kar hataya).
   Fix: `if (kDebugMode) const DebugPanel(),`

2. sql/ folder — profiles, favorites, songs table ka schema/RLS SQL MISSING hai
   CONFIRMED: repo mein sirf setup_likes.sql aur cleanup_optional.sql hai. 
   singers_with_song_count (view) aur increment_play_count (function) — dono 
   database mein use ho rahe hain (singers_service.dart, songs_service.dart) 
   par unki SQL definition kahin bhi repo mein nahi hai. Matlab RLS audit 
   possible hi nahi hai kyunki source of truth version control mein hi nahi hai.
   Fix: Supabase dashboard se poora schema dump karke sql/ folder mein migrations 
   add karo — especially profiles/favorites/songs RLS policies aur ye missing 
   view+function definitions.

3. increment_play_count / increment_like_count / decrement_like_count RPCs — auth check nahi
   CONFIRMED: In sabhi RPC functions mein koi `auth.uid() IS NULL` check nahi hai. 
   Koi bhi anon user directly RPC call karke play_count/like_count ko spam kar sakta hai.
   Fix: Function ke andar auth check daalo, ya trigger-based approach use karo 
   jo sirf actual insert/delete se automatically trigger ho.

4. lib/services/like_service.dart (addLike/removeLike, ~39-56) — non-atomic like operations
   Insert + count-update do alag network calls, atomic nahi. Fail hone par like_count desync.
   Fix: Single Postgres transaction/trigger mein combine karo (point 3 ke saath).

5. lib/providers/likes_provider.dart (toggleLike, ~105) — double-tap race condition
   In-flight lock nahi hai, rapid double-tap se local/server state mismatch hota hai.
   Fix: Per-songId "toggling" set rakho, duplicate call ignore karo.

6. android/app/build.gradle (~51) — release build debug key se sign ho sakta hai
   CONFIRMED: `signingConfig ... storeFile != null ? release : debug` — agar 
   release keystore missing hai to silently debug signing use ho jayega.
   Fix: Debug fallback hatao — release keystore missing ho to build FAIL hona chahiye, 
   silently debug-sign nahi.

7. lib/main.dart + lib/screens/splash/splash_screen.dart (~25) — init race condition
   Splash fixed 2-sec timer pe wait karta hai, real Supabase init async background 
   mein chalta hai. Slow network pe authProvider.loadCurrentUser() Supabase client 
   ready hone se pehle call ho sakta hai → exception.
   Fix: Completer/Future banao jo _initializeApp complete hone par resolve ho, 
   splash usko await kare.

8. lib/services/player_service.dart (next/previous, ~171-189) — currentIndex race condition
   seekToNext()/seekToPrevious() complete hone ke baad _currentIndex turant reliable 
   nahi hai — ye ek separate currentIndexStream listener se async update hota hai. 
   _trackPlayCount(_playlist[_currentIndex]) galat (purane) song ka play count 
   increment kar sakta hai agar stream event abhi tak fire nahi hua.
   Fix: currentIndexStream ke through hi play count track karo, ya seekToNext ke 
   baad player.currentIndex (synchronous getter agar available ho) use karo, 
   direct _currentIndex pe bharosa mat karo.

═══════════════════════════
🟡 MEDIUM
═══════════════════════════

9. lib/providers/likes_provider.dart (~57-85) — N+1 query problem
   50 songs ke liye 50+ alag API calls sequentially. Batch RPC banao.

10. lib/services/favorites_service.dart (fetchFavoriteSongs, ~59-96) — singer name missing
    `.select()` bina `singers(name)` join ke — Favorites screen pe "Unknown Artist" dikhega.
    Fix: `.select('*, singers(name)')` karo.

11. Cloudflare R2 audio URLs — public/unsigned, no expiry
    Poore codebase mein signing logic kahin nahi. Direct link se scraping/download risk.
    Fix: Signed URLs (15 min expiry) Edge Function se generate karo.

12. lib/services/player_service.dart (setPlaylist, ~109-113) — downloaded file existence check nahi
    CONFIRMED: `downloadedIds.contains(song.id)` true hone par bina file-exists 
    check kiye seedha local path use hota hai. Agar file delete/corrupt ho gayi 
    ho (manually ya storage cleanup se), playback fail hoga instead of falling 
    back to remote URL.
    Fix: Local file use karne se pehle `File(localPath).exists()` check karo, 
    missing ho to remote URL pe fallback karo aur stale entry SharedPreferences se hatao.

13. lib/providers/songs_provider.dart (loadMoreSongs, ~94) — poori list SharedPreferences mein re-save
    Har pagination call pe accumulated list phir se save hoti hai — scale nahi karega.
    Fix: sqflite/Hive use karo, ya sirf first page cache karo.

14. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (~104-110) — download content verify nahi hota
    Sirf file exists + size>0 check hota hai, corrupt partial download bhi valid maana jata hai.
    Fix: Content-Length match ya checksum verify karo.

15. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (~45) — songId direct file path mein
    Fix: UUID regex validate karo path banane se pehle.

16. lib/services/player_service.dart (_trackPlayCount, ~132) — playback fail hone par bhi play count badhta hai
    Fix: Actual playback start confirm hone ke baad count karo.

17. sql/setup_likes.sql (~18) — "Users can view all likes" — sabko sab dikhta hai
    Fix: `USING (auth.uid() = user_id)` karo, ya sirf like_count public rakho.

18. lib/main.dart (~90-99) — notification permission app launch pe hi maang liya jata hai
    Fix: Pehli baar audio play karne pe / background feature use karne pe maango.

19. lib/screens/player/widgets/album_art.dart (~40-48) — CachedNetworkImage memCache size set nahi
    CONFIRMED: 230x230 display size hai but full-resolution image RAM mein decode hoti hai.
    Fix: `memCacheWidth: 460, memCacheHeight: 460` (2x for retina) add karo — 
    yahi check song_row.dart aur singer profile images mein bhi karo.

20. lib/screens/player/widgets/album_art.dart (~23) — hardcoded gradient colors
    CONFIRMED: `Color(0xFF2A170D), Color(0xFF120C08)` theme se independent hai — 
    dark theme fallback lagta hai, light theme mein bhi same rahega.
    (Note: app_drawer.dart, mini_player_bar.dart, seek_bar.dart mein ye issue 
    NAHI mila — wo already fully themed hain, Meta ki us claim ko already reject kiya tha.)
    Fix: t.gradientColors jaisa theme field banao.

