    `Connectivity().onConnectivityChanged.listen((_) {})` — hatao ya use karo.

23. lib/services/downloads_service.dart (~117) — print() instead of debugPrint()

24. lib/services/auth_service.dart (~32) + premium_gate.dart — subscription_status client-writable
    Abhi immediate risk nahi (feature incomplete/TODO hai) but future-proof karna zaroori hai — 
    premium status sirf server-side set ho.

25. lib/config/supabase_config.dart (~6-7) — hardcoded dev fallback URL/anon key
    Cleanup ke liye hatao (anon key public-safe hai Supabase design mein, RLS real protection hai).

26. .gitignore — sirf `.env` hai
    Fix: android/key.properties, *.jks, *.keystore, build/, .dart_tool/ bhi add karo 
    taaki accidentally signing keys commit na ho jayein.

27. Error handling inconsistent — kahin silent `catch (_) {}`, kahin debugPrint, kahin Exception throw
    Poore codebase mein ek consistent pattern follow karo (Service → typed error → 
    Provider → user-facing message).

